WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.810
别信正在说话的我。
Don't trust the me who's talking.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.750
我没事，别叫人来。
I'm fine. Don't send anyone.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.710
我没事，别叫人来。
I'm fine. Don't send anyone.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.750
你接了。好。
You picked up. Okay.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:25.630
中心转播上的那个，不是我。不是现在的我。
Whatever's on the center feed, that's not me. Not now.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.250
门外有人。
Someone's at the door.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.650
别挂。告诉我怎么证明这是我。
Don't hang up. Tell me how to prove it's me.

00:00:33.969 --> 00:00:36.269
她：让她举两根手指，说“蓝伞”
Her: Have her raise two fingers and say "blue umbrella"
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.250
蓝伞。看到了吗？现在就是我。
Blue umbrella. See? It's me, right now.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.710
转播说我没事。可我根本没碰过那个杯子。
The feed says I'm fine. I haven't touched that cup.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:56.500
有人在试门。帮我弄门闩。
Someone's trying the door. Help me with the latch.

00:00:56.553 --> 00:00:58.853
她：让她看门闩，指挥她压到底
Her: Have her show the latch and push it all the way
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:59.053 --> 00:01:02.353
好，我拍给你看门闩。
Okay. I'll show you the latch.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.410
这样够了吗？
Is this far enough?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.750
顶住了。可他们还在外面。
It held. But they're still out there.

00:01:19.137 --> 00:01:21.250
她：让她拍墙上的终端
Her: Have her film the wall terminal
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:25.770
好。终端。等一下，我在看。
Okay. The terminal. Hold on, I'm looking.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:33.730
那是我的工号。我什么都没锁。
That's my ID. I didn't lock anything.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.150
你信我吗？还是我继续往下看？
Do you believe me? Or should I keep looking?

00:01:41.721 --> 00:01:43.970
她：让她拍下完整条目
Her: Have her capture the full entry
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:49.810
好。完整条目。我全都拍下来。
Okay. Full entry. I'll get all of it.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.950
委托会话。由运维账号发起。
Delegated session. Started from an operations account.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:57.730
有人用了我的名字。是故意的。
Someone used my name. On purpose.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.250
我们不能待在这儿。我走侧门。
We can't stay here. I'm taking the side door.

00:02:04.305 --> 00:02:06.605
她：让她先检查侧门的把手
Her: Have her check the side door handle first
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:11.670
先看把手，然后我们走。
Okay. Handle first. Then we move.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.210
从里面能开。这很好。
It opens from inside. That's good.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.350
Lena，转播只是故障，请保持冷静。
Lena, the relay is just glitching. Stay calm.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:23.330
请关掉自动备份，它在干扰系统。
Please switch off auto-backup. It's interfering.

00:02:26.889 --> 00:02:28.890
她：保持备份开启，让Lena走侧门
Her: Keep backup on. Lena takes the side door.
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.610
备份保持开启，我不会动它。
Backup stays on. I'm not touching it.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.530
走吧，跟紧我。
Let's go. Stay with me.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.730
关上了，没人跟来。
It's shut. Nobody followed.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.890
有人上来了，有钥匙声。
Someone's coming up. Keys.

00:02:49.473 --> 00:02:51.730
她：让她躲到拐角后观察
Her: Have her hide at the corner and watch
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:56.710
好。我躲好了，我在看。
Okay. I'm hiding. I'm watching.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:08.150
这边。快。
This way. Quickly.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.870
他有钥匙。我该信他吗？
He has a key. Do I trust him?

00:03:12.057 --> 00:03:14.357
她：让她举起两根手指给他看
Her: Have her hold up two fingers to him
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:19.130
两根手指。还是我。实时的。
Two fingers. Still me. Still live.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.490
他给我开了门。他不是在追我。
He opened the door. He's not chasing me.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.550
Hollis。维修工。快走。
Hollis. Maintenance. Keep moving.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:34.190
Voss说转播不能回放。查一下维护单。
Voss said the relay can't replay. Check the maintenance ticket.
